 "MEMO_BODY_HTML": "<div class=\"nv-detail\">\n<div class=\"memo-kicker\">Saltlight Aquarium · weekly memo · for the husbandry team</div>\n<div class=\"memo-h1\">Livestock health, <span class=\"memo-sub\">week of June 22</span></div>\n<div class=\"memo-meta-row\"><span>Fri Jun 26, 07:41 PT</span><span>11 exhibits</span><span>3 flags</span><span>3 actions</span></div>\n<span class=\"memo-conviction\">Mostly steady · two need a look</span>\n<p>Two exhibits need a look before the weekend; the third is already improving.</p>\n<div class=\"memo-h2\">Flags</div>\n<p><strong>Mangrove lagoon · improving.</strong> Nitrate read 12 ppm on Tuesday night, double its usual. Wednesday's water change brought it back to 6 ppm by Friday. The upside-down jellies are feeding normally.</p>\n<p><strong>Kelp forest · watch.</strong> One garibaldi has hidden at feeds three days running (keeper notes, Tue to Thu) and refused krill twice. Its photo is clear: no fin damage, colour normal.</p>\n<p><strong>Jelly gallery · needs a look.</strong> Two moon jellies show ragged bell margins in Monday's photos. Thursday's photo set arrived late and incomplete, so there is no second photo to compare.</p>\n<div class=\"memo-h2\">Actions</div>\n<p>1. <strong>Kelp team:</strong> Watch the garibaldi at Saturday's feed; offer mysis if it refuses krill again.</p>\n<p>2. <strong>Jelly team:</strong> Retake the kreisel photos on Saturday morning, before feeding.</p>\n<p>3. <strong>Water team:</strong> Keep the mangrove lagoon on nightly nitrate checks until it holds under 8 ppm for three nights.</p>\n<div class=\"memo-footnote-row\">Synthetic run 20260626-143012-09b3c9 · checked by std/evals/inspector</div>\n</div>",
 "MEMO_MORE_HTML": "<div class=\"nv-detail\">\n<div class=\"memo-h2\">Steady</div>\n<p>Reef wall, Seahorse nursery, Octopus den, Shark shallows, Touch pool, Eelgrass meadow, Rocky shore: no change this week.</p>\n<p><strong>Quarantine bay:</strong> Two captive-bred clownfish, day 12 of 30, eating well.</p>\n<div class=\"memo-h2\">Readings, Friday morning</div>\n<table class=\"memo-table\"><thead><tr><th>Exhibit</th><th>°C</th><th>ppt</th><th>nitrate ppm</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Reef wall</td><td class=\"fig\">25.6</td><td class=\"fig\">35.1</td><td class=\"fig\">2</td><td>steady</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Kelp forest</td><td class=\"fig\">14.2</td><td class=\"fig\">33.8</td><td class=\"fig\">4</td><td>steady</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Mangrove lagoon</td><td class=\"fig\">26.1</td><td class=\"fig\">31.9</td><td class=\"fig\">6</td><td>12 on Tue, after a water change 6</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Jelly gallery</td><td class=\"fig\">15.8</td><td class=\"fig\">33.2</td><td class=\"fig\">3</td><td>steady</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Seahorse nursery</td><td class=\"fig\">24.4</td><td class=\"fig\">34.6</td><td class=\"fig\">2</td><td>steady</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Octopus den</td><td class=\"fig\">13.9</td><td class=\"fig\">33.9</td><td class=\"fig\">5</td><td>steady</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Shark shallows</td><td class=\"fig\">23.8</td><td class=\"fig\">34.9</td><td class=\"fig\">7</td><td>steady</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Touch pool</td><td class=\"fig\">16.3</td><td class=\"fig\">33.5</td><td class=\"fig\">6</td><td>steady</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Eelgrass meadow</td><td class=\"fig\">15.1</td><td class=\"fig\">32.8</td><td class=\"fig\">3</td><td>steady</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Rocky shore</td><td class=\"fig\">14.8</td><td class=\"fig\">33.4</td><td class=\"fig\">4</td><td>steady</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Quarantine bay</td><td class=\"fig\">25.2</td><td class=\"fig\">34.8</td><td class=\"fig\">1</td><td>two clownfish, day 12</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"memo-h2\">Gaps</div>\n<p>Thursday's photo set for the jelly gallery arrived late and incomplete. The photo scout failed on it once, re-ran through a delegate, and had one of the two photos it needed; the inspector's check <code>photo_for_every_flag</code> failed for this exhibit.</p>\n</div>"
